# 1v1, cloud locks to the PC (BENCH-253), round 4: every per-robot line that locked on the cloud (12+ fresh seeds, 95%
# low end above 0, live turn time; coverage/shards/locks.tsv) after round 3 (PR #860) ran, locked on 12 fresh PC seeds:
#   sb (MOVE-45 speed band, off on master until this card holds it): Knowledge +2.6 (low +0.6)
#   dp (DIST-4 distance pin, off on master until this card holds it): Ololobot pinned at 625 px +3.2 (+1.3)
#   x0 (SHIELD-11 battle exit off): Spark +2.4 (+0.6, 24 seeds: +3.5 then +1.4)
#   vj (MOVE-44 velocity jitter): AspidReloaded +12.5 (+11.2)
#   hl (MOVE-28 stop-and-start): JahMicro +1.9 (+0.6), Rinmorikazu +1.2 (+0.5, 24 seeds)
#   Dreadnaught hl is off: its recheck on 12 fresh seeds gave +1.0 +- 3.0.
#   livematch  the released jar and BeepBoop 2.0 on the 31-robot panel at the live constant, read against live
#   lock       the 6 robots   c / aa / sb / dp / x0 / vj / hl (each lever arm built with only its own robots)   12 fresh seeds
#              from 43400, --cpu-constant live, in work/pc-locks4 (earlier rounds' battles stay in work/pc-locks to -locks3)
#   gate       each robot judged on its own arm only (lock_prep.py --restrict); it keeps its line where the 95% low end
#              is above 0 (mode_table.py --margin 0)
# Leigh starts it once the PC is free (one card at a time, from master):
#   git checkout master && git pull
#   .\queue.ps1 run pc-locks --fresh        (or  ./queue.sh run pc-locks --fresh)
#   --fresh because round 3 left this plan's queue state marked complete; an interrupted round 4 resumes without it.
# One bench queue, RoboRumble workers at 0, 16 workers, truth log off. 504 lock battles (6 robots, 7 arms, 12 seeds), about 15 minutes
# with the live-match check.
#
# Why it should win (the PC card rule of 2026-11-03):
#   - Per-opponent tailoring: every line names one robot; every other robot, team and melee play bit for bit as master.
#   - Diagnosis first:
#     sb: Knowledge's pattern matcher keys its history on Math.round of our velocity (jar scan of symbolic matchers,
#     shard G); a random 7 to 8 top speed each tick turns that symbol into noise, so its matches fail. Truncating
#     matchers (SHAM.WOW, Foilist, HedgehogP) did not lock and are off.
#     dp: in paired truth traces BeepBoop fights Ololobot about 120 px further out than we do; pinning our surf at 625 px
#     moved our realised distance from 501 to 613 px (shard D, coverage/shards/dist/).
#     x0: against Spark our shield leaves for the battle once 150 damage is taken (hadur.log off,damage), before about
#     round 10; BeepBoop never leaves. Keeping the shield on locked over 24 fresh cloud seeds (shard A). The same lever
#     failed on Quest in round 3 (-0.3), so this is its second PC test.
#     vj: AspidReloaded fires head-on at Saguaro and BeepBoop but a guess-factor spread at us: an exact-velocity matcher
#     like Booring (held +13.7 on the PC in round 3). With the jitter its aim goes head-on (share 0.28 to 0.72; shard A).
#     hl: Saguaro takes almost no hits from JahMicro, and stop-and-start screened +4.8 (shard C); Rinmorikazu screened
#     +2.2 and held over 24 fresh seeds. Pegasus hl held on the PC in round 3, Flex did not.
#   - Every robot passed the cloud lock bar first; round 1 held 8 of 13 such cloud locks on the PC (#843), round 2
#     held 6 of 12 (#845), round 3 held 17 of 25 (#860).
# Stop rules (docs/bench/watch.md): the watcher's A/A rule needs 10 robots read in both c and aa, which this 6-robot
# lock never reaches; aa is read in the gate (multiarm.py prints aa against c). The card halts on 30 failed
# battles, an arm scoring nothing in 8, 60+ skipped turns a battle over the last 24, or no battle in 30 minutes. The
# live-match step stops the card if the PC no longer scores us and BeepBoop as live does (tools/live_match.py exit 3).
# ALERT opens an issue for Leigh on any stop.
# Bank: the owning cloud thread adds the gate's lines on this card's results PR. Nothing is released by the card.
set V = 3.23
set P = --parallel 16 --no-truth-log --failed-ok
set C = --skip-build --skip-fetch --rounds 35 --cpu-constant live --child-heap 2G
set W = work/pc-locks4
set OUT = ../docs/bench/local
set ALERT = lgriffin

prep | git checkout -q master && mkdir -p bisect work && (cd .. && mvn -q -DskipTests package) && cp ../hadur-robot/target/hadur117.Hadur_${V}.jar bisect/ && bash ./build-ablation.sh aa && python3 tools/lock_prep.py plans/locks-pick.tsv panel-locks.txt plans/pc-locks.arms ${W}-prep && bash ${W}-prep/build.sh && for a in sb dp x0 vj hl; do test -f bisect/hadur117.Hadur_${V}$a.jar || exit 1; done && bash tools/fetch_live_jar.sh && ./fetch-opponents.sh --set panel-r31.txt && ./fetch-opponents.sh --set livematch-bb.txt && test -f opponents/kc.mega.BeepBoop_2.0.jar && ./fetch-opponents.sh --set panel-locks.txt && mvn -q compile

livematch | ./bench-top20.sh ${C} ${P} --set panel-r31.txt --seeds 2 --seed-base 21700 --arms plans/livematch.arms --out work/pc-livematch-rel-live --label pc-locks-livematch --shuffle-jobs && python3 tools/live_match.py work/pc-livematch-rel-live/arms.tsv --out ${OUT}/pc-locks4-livematch.md
  after: prep
  watch: field=1217
  stop: fails 30
  stop: dead 8
  stop: stall 30m

lock | ./bench-top20.sh ${C} ${P} --set panel-locks.txt --seeds 12 --seed-base 43400 --arms ${W}-prep/lock.arms --out ${W} --label pc-locks --shuffle-jobs
  after: livematch
  watch: field=1217
  stop: fails 30
  stop: dead 8
  stop: skips 60 over 24
  stop: stall 30m

gate | python3 ../data/tools/multiarm.py ${W}/arms.tsv --out ${OUT}/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)_pc-locks4-lock.md && python3 tools/lock_prep.py --restrict ${W}/arms.tsv ${W}-prep ${W}/arms-picked.tsv && python3 ../data/tools/mode_table.py ${W}/arms-picked.tsv --margin 0 --out-tsv ${OUT}/pc-locks4-lock-pick.tsv --out ${OUT}/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)_pc-locks4-lock-pick.md && python3 tools/per_robot.py ${W}/arms-picked.tsv --arms sb dp x0 vj hl --out ${OUT}/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)_pc-locks4-lock-per-robot.md --out-tsv ${OUT}/pc-locks4-lock-per-robot.tsv
  after: lock

pr | bash tools/open_results_pr.sh claude/pc-locks4-results "1v1 cloud locks, round 4 (6 robots from the field shards) locked on 12 fresh PC seeds" ${OUT}/pc-locks4-livematch.md ${OUT}/*_pc-locks4-*.md ${OUT}/pc-locks4-lock-per-robot.tsv $(find ${OUT} -maxdepth 1 -name 'pc-locks4-lock-pick.tsv' -size +0c)
  after: gate
